<%- include('partials/header', { pageTitle: 'About Us', pageDescription: 'Learn about RPM Glass - over 12 years of excellence in commercial and residential glass solutions serving Massachusetts.' }) %>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>About Us</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>About RPM Glass</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Your Trusted Partner in Glass Solutions</p>
      <p>With over 12 years of industry experience, RPM Glass has established itself as a leader in commercial and residential glass solutions throughout Massachusetts.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="https://images.leadconnectorhq.com/image/f_webp/q_80/r_1200/u_https://assets.cdn.filesafe.space/gqZLaxiRnT93o0AopLh3/media/11c67bf6-90b0-41ef-853c-11ba75d4bcdc.jpeg" alt="Commercial Glass Installation">
        </div>
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Our Story</h2>
          <p>At RPM Glass, we are dedicated to providing top-quality glass solutions tailored to meet the unique needs of both residential and commercial clients. What started as a small operation has grown into a trusted name in the glass industry, serving businesses and homeowners across Massachusetts.</p>
          <p>With years of industry experience, we specialize in everything from heavy glass installations and safety glass to custom storefronts and elegant wine rooms. Our team of skilled professionals brings expertise, precision, and care to every project.</p>
          <p>Our commitment to transparent pricing and safety ensures that every project is completed with the highest standards. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients through honest communication and exceptional workmanship.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
        <p>These principles guide everything we do at RPM Glass.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <h4>💰 Transparent Pricing</h4>
          <p>Clear, upfront pricing with no hidden fees. We provide detailed quotes so you know exactly what you're paying for before we start any work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <h4>🛡️ Safety First</h4>
          <p>Prioritizing safety in every project we undertake. All our installations meet or exceed building codes and industry safety standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <h4>✨ Quality Craftsmanship</h4>
          <p>We take pride in our work. Every installation is completed with meticulous attention to detail and the highest quality materials.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <h4>🤝 Customer Focus</h4>
          <p>Your satisfaction is our priority. We work closely with each client to understand their needs and deliver solutions that exceed expectations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;">
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Why Choose RPM Glass?</h2>
          <ul class="features-list" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
            <li>Over 12 years of industry experience</li>
            <li>1,000+ successful projects completed</li>
            <li>Licensed and insured professionals</li>
            <li>Residential and commercial expertise</li>
            <li>Custom solutions for unique requirements</li>
            <li>Competitive and transparent pricing</li>
            <li>Quality materials and installation</li>
            <li>Serving all of Massachusetts</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="https://images.leadconnectorhq.com/image/f_webp/q_80/r_1200/u_https://assets.cdn.filesafe.space/gqZLaxiRnT93o0AopLh3/media/2187d149-3327-402d-9cbf-fcf51fce793c.jpeg" alt="Glass Storage Room">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Service Area</h2>
        <p>Proudly serving businesses and homeowners throughout Massachusetts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 30px;">Based in Northborough, MA, RPM Glass provides commercial and residential glass services throughout the Greater Boston area and beyond. From hospital-grade commercial projects to home services, no job is too big or too small.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/contact" class="cta-button">Get a Free Quote</a>
          <a href="tel:+17744569850" class="cta-button outline">Call <%= company.phone %></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
      <p>Contact us today for a free consultation and quote on your glass project.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="cta-button">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
